{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30745","headline":"梦游仙 · 项斯","name":"梦游仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梦游飞上天家楼，珠箔当风挂玉钩。\n鹦鹉隔帘呼再拜，水仙移镜嬾梳头。\n丹霞不是人间晓，碧树仍逢岫外秋。\n将谓便长於此地，鸡声入耳所堪愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项斯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}